

acme.validation.header.message  	= Must have from 1 to 75 characters
acme.validation.text.message   		= Must have from 1 to 255 characters
acme.validation.phone.message       = Must match +country-code (area-code) phone-number, where only the phone-number is mandatory 
acme.validation.job.ticker.message			  = The ticker must have letters, digits, underscores, and hyphens only
acme.validation.iata.message        = The IATA code must contain exactly 3 uppercase letters.
acme.validation.cargo.message       = The cargo weight must be between 2,000 and 50,000 kg.
acme.validation.promo.error.message = The promotion code must contain four uppercase letters, a hyphen, and the last two digits must correspond to the current year (e.g., ABCD-25).
acme.validation.promo.last-digits.message = The promotion code must end with the last two digits of the current year.
acme.validation.score.message = The score must be between 0 and 10, with a maximum of one decimal place.
acme.validation.flight.number.message = The flight number must consist of 3 uppercase letters followed by 4 digits (example: ABC1234).
acme.validation.passport.message = Invalid passport number. It must be 6 to 9 characters long, using only uppercase letters and numbers.
acme.validation.locatorCode.message = Invalid locator code. It must be between 6 and 8 characters long, using only uppercase letters and numbers.
acme.validation.earnedPoints.message = Invalid points value. Customers can have up to 500,000 points.
acme.validation.identifier.message = Invalid identifier. It must start with 2 to 3 uppercase letters (A-Z), followed by exactly 6 digits (0-9).
acme.validation.lastnibble.message = The last nibble must be exactly 4 digits.